  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "- Breaking change: complete format overhaul.\n      - Preamble is now mandatory (ARCH + flags + optional comment) on every archive.\n      - Setup() and Generate() accept optional string key parameter.\n      - Added XOR obfuscation: table and body are XORed with SHA256(user key) when a key is provided.\n      - VerifyCrc no longer has silent early returns — CRC is always strictly verified.\n      - Flags byte: bit 0 = has comment, bit 1 = obfuscated.\n      - CRC is now stored at a fixed position in the preamble (right after the optional comment).\n      - CRC covers the Header and Body sections only; any bytes appended past the body are ignored during verification.\n      - Added optional verifyCrc parameter to Setup() (default true) to disable CRC verification when not needed.",
